                                       ; +3 for 81.98's menu save-under;
                                       ; +1 for 81.96.2's close-box byte;
                                       ; +1 for 81.97's document kind;
                                       ; +60 for 81.96's DIALOG.BOX: the
                                       ; window, its done byte, one line
