                                       ; +5 for 81.94's MACRO.OVL pointer and
                                       ; its failure byte;
                                       ; +25 for 81.92's ON.KEY table and
                                       ; ON.TIME's flag;
                                       ; +4 for 81.89's SH_IDENT_MAX 20;
                                       ; +4 for 81.89's NOTE vector (147);
                                       ; +4 for 81.88's menu vector (146);
                                       ; +4 for 81.87's GET.NOTE vector (145);
                                       ; +11 for 81.86: three macro bytes (the
                                       ; alert's set and answer, Esc) and
                                       ; SH_NVEC 142 -> 144;
                                       ; +38 for 81.71's Data commands: 26 of
                                       ; state (the extract range, Delete's
